WEBVTT

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.598
Jimmy wanted to become a soldier,
but, thanks to Candy,

00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:18.714
he decided to stay home
and take care of the farm.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:24.787
Candy left Pony's Home again.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:32.829
The troublesome love

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.585
I haven't seen Chicago's streets
for a long time.

00:01:00.735 --> 00:01:03.493
So many people!

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.255
I want one too.

00:01:07.425 --> 00:01:12.404
Of course, miss. What flavour?
Chocolate? Vanilla? Strawberry?

00:01:12.554 --> 00:01:17.509
Hum... I would like chocolate.

00:01:17.719 --> 00:01:18.970
OK.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.803
- Here, chocolate.
- Thank you!

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.616
So yummy!

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.317
It's dangerous to drive so fast.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:39.657
Oh my...

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:41.893
How can somebody drive like this?

00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:44.061
I hope he's okay.

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.713
No one wants to help him?

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.149
Are you OK?

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.983
Neil?

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.951
Candy.

00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:10.052
Everything's all right.
You can go now.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.794
Candy.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.331
You are hurt!

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:23.468
I think it's OK now. If you worry,
come to the hospital tomorrow.

00:02:23.618 --> 00:02:25.036
I won't go to the hospital.
It's none of your business!

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:29.349
Do as you wish. I must go now.

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:34.309
He hasn't changed a bit!

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:38.852
This is the second time she saved me.

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.589
Candy... I thought I hated her.

00:02:44.739 --> 00:02:51.069
But how come now I can't stop
thinking about her?

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:54.365
Come and buy my oranges,
they are cheap!

00:02:54.515 --> 00:02:57.669
They come from California.

00:02:57.819 --> 00:03:03.241
They seem delicious.
I will buy some for Mr Albert.

00:03:03.391 --> 00:03:06.611
Welcome! Please buy some.

00:03:06.761 --> 00:03:10.381
Perhaps vitamin C will help his memory.

00:03:10.531 --> 00:03:15.335
Delicious!

00:03:15.485 --> 00:03:16.588
Give me two.

00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:18.490
Only two?

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.593
But we don't sell them by two,
we sell them by five only, madam.

00:03:21.743 --> 00:03:23.294
Madam?

00:03:23.444 --> 00:03:27.231
Your husband will be very happy too.

00:03:27.381 --> 00:03:29.334
But I am not a madam!

00:03:29.484 --> 00:03:31.502
Come, come.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:41.010
That's impolite.
Calling such a young lady madam!

00:04:03.775 --> 00:04:06.404
Help me!

00:04:10.115 --> 00:04:12.312
Help me!

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:19.484
Don't get upset, here people use
"madam" as a sign of respect.

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:21.386
Oh...

00:04:21.536 --> 00:04:25.523
If you had said you'd came back earlier,
I'd have cooked something good!

00:04:25.673 --> 00:04:29.093
I can take over.

00:04:29.243 --> 00:04:31.229
Would you mind to set the table?

00:04:31.379 --> 00:04:32.471
OK.

00:04:38.375 --> 00:04:40.867
I thought the cover
was going to explode in my face!

00:04:41.017 --> 00:04:42.839
The fire is too big.

00:04:42.989 --> 00:04:45.243
I am not used to simply simmer!

00:04:45.393 --> 00:04:46.811
You're not used to a small kitchen?

00:04:46.961 --> 00:04:50.151
I will do it.
Candy, you set the table.

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:54.783
It seems I'll never be a good wife.

00:04:55.828 --> 00:05:01.025
Don't worry, Candy,
you will be a very good wife.

00:05:01.175 --> 00:05:04.796
You are so sweet to me,
even though you don't know who I am.

00:05:04.946 --> 00:05:09.365
I think that's enough.

00:05:15.147 --> 00:05:17.583
Poope!

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:30.421
This big hospital is so different
from where I just came.

00:05:30.571 --> 00:05:33.691
The clinic in the mountains
can't be compared to this.

00:05:33.841 --> 00:05:37.862
Candice, somebody wants to talk to you.

00:05:38.012 --> 00:05:39.631
Somebody?

00:05:39.781 --> 00:05:41.432
He's in the guest room.

00:05:41.582 --> 00:05:43.434
In the guest room? Thank you!

00:05:43.584 --> 00:05:45.306
Who could it be?

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:52.314
It's me.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:02.754
Neil, it's you?

00:06:02.904 --> 00:06:04.722
Please see me.

00:06:04.872 --> 00:06:06.291
See you?

00:06:06.441 --> 00:06:08.675
I need to have my injuries checked.

00:06:08.825 --> 00:06:11.562
Cut it out! You are fine.

00:06:11.712 --> 00:06:15.667
And if you came to see the doctor,
you'll have to wait like everyone else.

00:06:15.817 --> 00:06:18.900
Please go to the front desk.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.805
Wait, Candy.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:23.808
What else?

00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:25.977
I am OK now.

00:06:26.127 --> 00:06:27.645
What else do you want?

00:06:27.795 --> 00:06:30.909
I want you to be my date.

00:06:31.159 --> 00:06:33.158
Your date?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.421
Yes, go and change now.

00:06:36.571 --> 00:06:37.689
What is going on?

00:06:37.839 --> 00:06:43.061
Nothing. I want you as my date.

00:06:43.211 --> 00:06:45.763
You want to thank me for saving you?

00:06:45.913 --> 00:06:47.198
If it's the case,
don't worry about it.

00:06:47.348 --> 00:06:49.968
Are you deaf?
I am telling you to go change!

00:06:50.218 --> 00:06:52.070
I refuse.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:52.870
What?

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.539
Because I am working now.

00:06:54.689 --> 00:06:57.275
I have already talked to
vice-principal Leonard.

00:06:57.425 --> 00:06:59.911
You said you are from the Aldley's?

00:07:00.061 --> 00:07:02.613
Is that a problem?

00:07:02.763 --> 00:07:04.615
It is, for me.

00:07:04.765 --> 00:07:06.352
If you think you can solve everything

00:07:06.502 --> 00:07:08.219
simply by saying you are
from the Adley's that's unacceptable.

00:07:08.369 --> 00:07:10.555
I don't care
what Dr Leonard thinks,

00:07:10.705 --> 00:07:14.122
I have patients waiting for me.
Please excuse me!

00:07:18.237 --> 00:07:19.997
Candy...

00:07:20.147 --> 00:07:25.670
He wants to date me,
what on Earth is going on?

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.975
Excuse me!

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:41.486
How did she dare
refuse my invitation?

00:07:41.636 --> 00:07:45.559
I am not going to quit, I'll date her!

00:07:48.935 --> 00:07:52.030
How to get a date with a girl?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.066
A friend asked me.

00:07:55.216 --> 00:07:58.597
And I have no experience.

00:07:58.747 --> 00:08:04.275
He should use gentle words
and ask her politely.

00:08:04.425 --> 00:08:07.046
He should be nice to her...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:11.215
Don't tell about this to anyone!

00:08:11.365 --> 00:08:13.383
Yes.

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:19.257
There's brother.

00:08:21.407 --> 00:08:23.494
What does he want to do
with those roses?

00:08:23.644 --> 00:08:25.935
You can go back now, I'll manage.

00:08:36.616 --> 00:08:37.708
See you!

00:08:37.858 --> 00:08:39.751
See you! See you tomorrow!

00:08:40.887 --> 00:08:41.946
Neil?

00:08:42.096 --> 00:08:43.714
Candy.

00:08:45.264 --> 00:08:46.717
Are these for me?

00:08:46.867 --> 00:08:47.960
Yes.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:53.227
Brother with her!
What is he planning?

00:08:55.535 --> 00:08:58.362
Now that I am nice to you,
please accept to go out with me.

00:08:58.512 --> 00:09:00.701
Don't say you're on duty now.

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:04.976
Aren't you pleased?

00:09:08.748 --> 00:09:10.675
Of course not!

00:09:10.825 --> 00:09:12.076
Candy!

00:09:12.226 --> 00:09:15.280
You took my flowers,
and yet you don't accept my invitation.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.382
If so, take them back.

00:09:18.532 --> 00:09:23.354
I don't want anything to do with you.
Not now, not tomorrow, never!

00:09:23.504 --> 00:09:25.454
Good bye.

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:31.863
I am ashamed of my brother!

00:09:39.243 --> 00:09:41.407
Damn!

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:47.853
Grrrr...

00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:58.622
How could he fall in
love with such a girl?

00:10:08.608 --> 00:10:10.568
Just who do he thinks I am?

00:10:10.718 --> 00:10:13.838
To go out on a date with Neil!

00:10:14.088 --> 00:10:16.679
I get sick just thinking about it!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.883
It's terrible.

00:10:26.033 --> 00:10:29.621
Tonight, I won't eat well!

00:10:30.096 --> 00:10:32.757
I will not take credit with you anymore.

00:10:32.907 --> 00:10:35.355
Please give me a chocolate ice cream!

00:10:35.505 --> 00:10:37.128
Welcome.

00:10:37.278 --> 00:10:40.364
Please leave!
You are disturbing our customers.

00:10:40.514 --> 00:10:43.267
Please, just for this time.

00:10:43.417 --> 00:10:47.838
No! Do you think someone
gives me whisky for free?

00:10:47.988 --> 00:10:49.557
Leave!

00:10:49.757 --> 00:10:51.976
Please.

00:10:52.126 --> 00:10:54.145
No money, no money.

00:10:54.295 --> 00:10:57.415
Wait, you can't throw someone out
just because he doesn't have any money.

00:10:57.565 --> 00:10:59.517
Oh, what did you say?

00:10:59.667 --> 00:11:01.886
Forget it, just a whisky.
I will buy it.

00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:04.001
I don't want ice cream any more.

00:11:04.171 --> 00:11:06.390
Wait, miss...

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.759
Please just give him what he wants
and I will pay you.

00:11:08.909 --> 00:11:10.294
How much?

00:11:10.444 --> 00:11:12.430
I know, I know.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.265
Only this time, Mr. Martin.

00:11:14.415 --> 00:11:16.274
Mr. Martin?

00:11:17.443 --> 00:11:19.170
Thank you.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.839
A drunken doctor, amazing...

00:11:23.989 --> 00:11:25.850
Doctor Martin!

00:11:28.354 --> 00:11:33.492
Wait! Doctor Martin!

00:11:36.896 --> 00:11:40.057
Thank you, Candy.

00:11:40.207 --> 00:11:43.693
Doctor, why playing this game?

00:11:44.203 --> 00:11:46.597
Life needs acting.

00:11:46.747 --> 00:11:47.632
No medicine will cure you!

00:11:47.782 --> 00:11:50.668
If you drink like this,
you will have no patients!

00:11:50.818 --> 00:11:52.637
I have plenty.

00:11:52.787 --> 00:11:55.374
But somehow I always forget
to ask them for my fee!

00:11:56.582 --> 00:12:00.886
That's right, I still have to pay you
for Mr. Albert.

00:12:03.622 --> 00:12:05.249
That's all right.

00:12:05.399 --> 00:12:07.551
Do you know if he'll
recover his memory soon?

00:12:07.701 --> 00:12:10.060
He doesn't know much about himself.

00:12:13.232 --> 00:12:15.393
He doesn't know much at all.

00:12:15.543 --> 00:12:18.804
When he recovers his memory,
I know he'll go to you first.

00:12:20.206 --> 00:12:22.600
Here, this is for you.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.369
Ah, your wisdom puzzle.

00:12:25.519 --> 00:12:29.210
This is the perfect cure for you.

00:12:29.882 --> 00:12:34.211
It calms you down
when you're anxious.

00:12:34.361 --> 00:12:36.414
Thank you, doctor!

00:12:36.564 --> 00:12:39.458
Good bye!

00:12:43.362 --> 00:12:46.390
The wisdom puzzle is really hard.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.366
That's like this. No.

00:12:52.605 --> 00:12:54.505
This sound is...

00:13:10.055 --> 00:13:11.716
Yes!

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:45.716
Where is the prince in the hill now,
I wonder?

00:13:45.866 --> 00:13:47.918
It's nearly ten years, now...

00:13:48.068 --> 00:13:50.654
But I can remember it clearly.

00:13:50.804 --> 00:13:54.165
Little thing,
you are lovelier when you're smiling.

00:14:00.206 --> 00:14:03.107
He and Anthony were so much alike...

00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:15.617
and Terry...

00:14:15.821 --> 00:14:18.085
Will I see Terry again?

00:14:43.515 --> 00:14:48.012
I should forget about all this...

00:14:48.162 --> 00:14:50.078
Cheer up, Candy!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.155
Brother?

00:15:00.966 --> 00:15:02.691
Brother?

00:15:04.169 --> 00:15:05.529
Brother?

00:15:05.679 --> 00:15:08.732
I've been looking for you.
You have a guest.

00:15:08.882 --> 00:15:09.733
A guest?

00:15:09.883 --> 00:15:11.135
It's Daisy Dalman.

00:15:11.285 --> 00:15:12.970
Who's she?

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.839
My friend.

00:15:14.989 --> 00:15:18.242
You saw her once or twice,
at my parties.

00:15:18.392 --> 00:15:21.178
She would really like to meet you,

00:15:21.328 --> 00:15:25.387
she's the daughter of a rich man.

00:15:25.658 --> 00:15:31.088
He is very powerful, and we could use
him to have Candy leave Chicago

00:15:31.238 --> 00:15:33.757
You still want to get rid of her?

00:15:33.907 --> 00:15:36.994
Yes, as we already discussed,
did you change your mind or what?

00:15:37.144 --> 00:15:40.064
Yes of course. What is your plan?

00:15:40.214 --> 00:15:43.133
I am angry because I feel
I am the only one involved in this.

00:15:43.283 --> 00:15:47.972
Aunt Elroy only cares about bringing
Stear back from Europe.

00:15:48.122 --> 00:15:51.175
George told me yesterday
that Uncle William was back in the area,

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:54.378
and that he was not very healthy.

00:15:54.528 --> 00:15:56.447
He told me he was quite sick.

00:15:56.597 --> 00:15:58.482
He must be very old.

00:15:58.632 --> 00:16:02.853
I was thinking, if Uncle William dies,
Aunt Elroy will take over.

00:16:03.003 --> 00:16:06.156
This would be a perfect situation
to get rid of Candy!

00:16:06.306 --> 00:16:09.126
I pray for this to happen!

00:16:09.276 --> 00:16:11.128
You are praying
for Uncle's William's death?

00:16:11.278 --> 00:16:16.567
Yes of course!
Candy can't live happily here in Chicago!

00:16:16.717 --> 00:16:21.339
My mind will be at peace
only when she is gone.

00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:23.809
Ah... Yes.

00:16:24.683 --> 00:16:25.843
Brother,

00:16:25.993 --> 00:16:28.245
I want you to be Daisy's friend.
Do you hear me?

00:16:28.495 --> 00:16:30.679
Yes.

00:16:32.224 --> 00:16:36.923
Daisy Dalman. Such a boring woman!

00:16:46.105 --> 00:16:48.365
Daisy, have you seen my brother yet?

00:16:48.515 --> 00:16:50.367
No, not yet.

00:16:50.517 --> 00:16:53.537
Strange, I talked to him a while ago...

00:16:55.687 --> 00:16:59.209
Miss, your brother said
he's not feeling well, he won't come.

00:16:59.359 --> 00:17:01.445
Really?

00:17:05.557 --> 00:17:08.085
Brother!
Brother!

00:17:08.235 --> 00:17:10.321
Brother?

00:17:17.803 --> 00:17:24.265
He ran away! All that trouble
to have him met Daisy...

00:17:29.212 --> 00:17:30.575
This is...

00:17:30.816 --> 00:17:32.992
Candy!

00:17:33.142 --> 00:17:34.578
This is Candy's.

00:17:34.728 --> 00:17:38.316
He got caught in Candy's trap.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.084
She will pay for this.

00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:44.488
Neil is in love with Candy?

00:17:44.638 --> 00:17:46.423
I don't believe it...

00:17:46.573 --> 00:17:49.493
Mother, the true story is...

00:17:49.643 --> 00:17:52.529
Candy simply wants to trap him.

00:17:52.679 --> 00:17:54.965
She gave this to Brother.

00:17:55.115 --> 00:17:56.767
Her handkerchief!

00:17:56.917 --> 00:17:59.970
He kept it, so I am sure he loves her.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.338
What's this?

00:18:01.488 --> 00:18:04.174
Soon, Brother will say
he wants to get married.

00:18:04.324 --> 00:18:06.977
This is out of the question!
I will not allow it.

00:18:07.127 --> 00:18:09.880
Yes, I agree with you completely.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.518
Mother, we have to find a way
to get rid of Candy.

00:18:14.668 --> 00:18:17.488
Brother doesn't realize
he's been bewitched!

00:18:17.638 --> 00:18:19.256
Poor Brother!

00:18:19.406 --> 00:18:22.426
Eliza, ask the driver
to take out the car.

00:18:22.576 --> 00:18:24.061
Now, Eliza!

00:18:24.511 --> 00:18:27.496
OK, Mother.

00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:35.539
Wait, I will go too.

00:18:35.689 --> 00:18:39.350
No, this is none of your business.
Go!

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:44.915
We're going to take care of you, Candy.

00:18:45.065 --> 00:18:46.984
What did you say?

00:18:47.134 --> 00:18:49.755
Me? Nothing...

00:19:06.044 --> 00:19:08.439
What's happened, Mrs. Leagan?

00:19:08.589 --> 00:19:09.440
Are you ill?

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:12.309
I came here to discuss
about Candice.

00:19:12.459 --> 00:19:15.182
About Candice?

00:19:17.254 --> 00:19:19.283
I want you to fire her now.

00:19:19.433 --> 00:19:23.387
Fire her? What happened?

00:19:23.537 --> 00:19:26.056
Don't ask any questions.

00:19:27.506 --> 00:19:31.361
Without a good reason,
I can't fire any of my employees.

00:19:31.511 --> 00:19:35.941
I guess you would like to keep
your position in this hospital?

00:19:37.943 --> 00:19:39.269
I could talk to my husband

00:19:39.419 --> 00:19:42.339
and have him stop helping the hospital.

00:19:43.389 --> 00:19:47.144
Don't let a single nurse destroy you!

00:19:47.294 --> 00:19:49.746
Why do you hate her so much?

00:19:49.896 --> 00:19:54.121
She troubles me.

00:20:07.039 --> 00:20:10.950
Later, the boy and the girl found
a strange little house,

00:20:11.185 --> 00:20:16.775
it was made of ginger bread,
sugar and licorice.

00:20:18.383 --> 00:20:20.707
Candice,
Dr. Leonard wants to see you.

00:20:20.927 --> 00:20:22.346
OK!

00:20:22.496 --> 00:20:26.255
Wait, I will be back soon.

00:20:33.031 --> 00:20:34.521
Come in.

00:20:37.536 --> 00:20:39.363
You asked to see me?

00:20:39.513 --> 00:20:41.265
Candice.

00:20:41.415 --> 00:20:45.544
This is your last day here.

00:20:51.116 --> 00:20:53.141
What's wrong?

00:20:53.585 --> 00:20:58.545
I'm sorry,
but I have been asked to fire you.

00:21:04.496 --> 00:21:09.193
Candy knows she won't find work
in any other hospital in the area.

00:21:09.343 --> 00:21:12.237
Candy feels very bad.

00:21:13.538 --> 00:21:16.996
She doesn't understand.
What happened? What did she do wrong?

00:21:18.143 --> 00:21:23.080
It felt like she had been struck
by lightning.

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:27.100
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by Rémi
